# Prompt deployment

Keep prompt content versioned separately from application releases. Request the version labeled for an environment, then attach its id to the generation span.

```ts
const response = await fetch("https://tracify.tech/api/prompts/support-agent?environment=production", {
  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.TRACIFY_API_KEY}` },
});
const { version } = await response.json();
const prompt = version.content;
```

Use development, staging, and production labels to promote deliberately. Keep the API key server-side and record `version.id` as `promptVersionId` during ingestion.
